    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1053">

                <pb facs="0910" n="794" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg794"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/14687.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Silliman
                        to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vera Cruz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-03-25">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 25, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The matter pertaining to situation on border, Department’s March 24, was
                    presented to Mr. Zubaran as General Carranza continues sick in bed. I was
                    assured that immediate orders would be given to avoid the possibility
                    feared.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Silliman.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
